  "spec_version": "settlement-evidence-ref-v1",
  "description": "Additive vectors: the settlement_artifact carries an extra field with data where RFC 8785 and json.dumps(sort_keys=True) differ (a key outside the BMP; number forms). A verifier that canonicalizes with sort_keys computes another settlement_evidence_ref and rejects them.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "jcs-astral-key-001",
      "description": "RFC 8785 key order. The settlement_artifact carries an extra field `ext` with two keys, U+FFFF and U+1F600. RFC 8785 orders keys by UTF-16 code unit, so U+1F600 (D83D DE00) sorts before U+FFFF; ordering by code point gives the reverse and a different settlement_evidence_ref. Otherwise identical to settlement-matched-001: all four checks pass.",
      "expected": "PASS",
      "settlement_artifact": {
        "network": "base-sepolia",
        "transaction": "0x7c8692c003b80a48bb8123ae6965e26464d271ee2041404cc025e0f15e5fcaba",
